body:
The fixed `setTimeout(..., 500)` delay adds unnecessary latency and can still be flaky (slow machines may need longer). Since `src/main.tsx` awaits `startMockServer()` before rendering, prefer removing the delay and relying on `connect()`/`startMockServer()` to indicate readiness (or add an explicit readiness signal).
```suggestion
      // MSW mock server is started before React renders (see main.tsx),
      // so we can connect directly without an artificial delay.
```
